### cases of error

### Create a new Image with empty fields (error: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pictures/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "link": ""
}

### Create a new Image with missing fields (error: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pictures/create
Content-Type: application/json

{}